'''An'she's Respite''' is a tauren camp inhabited by the [[Shadewalkers]], a group that splintered from the [[Moonhoof tribe]] and no longer answers to their chieftain. Warped by vengeance, they chose to embrace [[Lo'sho]]'s darker side, their foul chants twist their ancestors from their rest to serve.

